#~| "I sent a messenger to the king about our plight, but some misfortune "
#~| "must have befallen him, for you are the first reinforcements to arrive "
#~| "here. If only Sir Loris had sent a rider earlier, he might have survived "
#~| "long enough to stand with us here."
#~ msgid ""
